{"nodeId":760440201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":820903866,"text":"懸賞金がかかってる対象の情報は全部掲示板に載ってる。話には付き合うが、賞金の額については相談に乗れないからな。","nextNodeIds":[760440202]},{"nodeId":760440202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":4231182242,"text":"懸賞金のターゲットについて…","nextNodeIds":[760440203]},{"nodeId":760440203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":460658106,"text":"掲示板には四人載ってるが、手がかりがあるのはそのうち三人だ。詐欺の容疑で懸賞金がかかってるのは…","nextNodeIds":[760440204]},{"nodeId":760440204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":1271910650,"text":"…おい、待てって！新米のトレジャーハンターをそうやってあしらうのは知ってるけど、あたいにまでそんな対応かよ？何が聞きたいかは分かってるんだろ。","nextNodeIds":[760440205]},{"nodeId":760440205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":1276573850,"text":"「秘聞の館」が介入するのか？","nextNodeIds":[760440206]},{"nodeId":760440206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2245282346,"text":"それはうちのボス次第…ん？なんであたいが逆に質問されてんだよ？","nextNodeIds":[760440207]},{"nodeId":760440207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":384320578,"text":"「裂けアゴ」のハルクは未だに見つかってないみたいだけど、あんたらの出してる情報が曖昧すぎるせいじゃないのか？なんで外見の特徴すら書かれてないんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[760440208]},{"nodeId":760440208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":2904600442,"text":"そんなことも知らんトレジャーハンターに、ハルクの相手が務まるはずがない。彼らの時間…そして命を無駄にすることはない。","nextNodeIds":[760440209]},{"nodeId":760440209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":1958800682,"text":"わかったよ。それじゃあ、顎の恐ろしい傷痕以外に特徴はあるか？他のやつが知らないようなやつでさ。","nextNodeIds":[760440210]},{"nodeId":760440210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":2090341698,"text":"他の人が知らない…例えば、背中にある印みたいなもの——とかか？","nextNodeIds":[760440211]},{"nodeId":760440211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2400527914,"text":"そう。そういうやつだよ！ホントにあったんだな！っていうか、そんなことなんで知ってるんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[760440212]},{"nodeId":760440212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":2688355562,"text":"ただの例だ。俺も知らん。仮にあったとして、どうやって確かめるつもりだ？","nextNodeIds":[760440213]},{"nodeId":760440213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2303664234,"text":"そ、それもそうか…はぁ、本当に特ダネは持ってないのか？あたいらの仲だろ、何か教えてくれよ。","nextNodeIds":[760440214]},{"nodeId":760440214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":3057530402,"text":"ハルクはナシャタウンで本性を現してから、レンポ島北部へ逃げ、そこで今も悪事の限りを働いている。","nextNodeIds":[760440215]},{"nodeId":760440215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":333044626,"text":"それは知ってるよ。前に聞いたからな。","nextNodeIds":[760440216]},{"nodeId":760440216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":702164834,"text":"でも最近は消息が途絶えてるんだろ？北部へ行ったとすれば…ピラミダならいいけど、もしスネージナヤ・グラードに向かってたら…","nextNodeIds":[760440217]},{"nodeId":760440217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":404965434,"text":"（極寒の地だぞ。あたいの腕、耐えきれるのか…？）","nextNodeIds":[760440218]},{"nodeId":760440218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":3430128266,"text":"いや、やつはまだレンポ島にいるはずだ。ただし隠れ場所が分かっていない。これは特ダネだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[760440219]},{"nodeId":760440219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":2180314754,"text":"えっ、どうしてそう確信できるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[760440220]},{"nodeId":760440220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":44541754,"text":"それは企業秘密だ。別料金。","nextNodeIds":[760440221]},{"nodeId":760440221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":4195163538,"text":"ちぇっ、ケチだな。はぁ…顎に傷跡がある男なんて、レンポ島でだって十歩歩いたら一人はいるだろ。どうやって探せってんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[760440222]},{"nodeId":760440222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":344242538,"text":"なら、俺たちの仲に免じて一つアドバイスだ。顎の傷痕にばかりとらわれるな。","nextNodeIds":[760440223]},{"nodeId":760440223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":94845850,"text":"…それはつまり、何かしらの手を使って顎の傷痕を隠してるかもってことか？","nextNodeIds":[760440224]},{"nodeId":760440224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":269326914,"text":"なるほどな…やつが「裂けアゴ」って呼ばれてるのは、特徴的な傷跡のせいだ。逆に言えば、傷跡がなければ他の男と見分けがつかないってことか…","nextNodeIds":[760440225]},{"nodeId":760440225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","textMapHash":1347381962,"text":"つまり、顎を気にして隠そうとしてる男を探せばいいってことだな。こりゃ新たな手がかりになるぞ。よし、進展があったらまた来るからな。","nextNodeIds":[760440226]},{"nodeId":760440226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","textMapHash":2744374274,"text":"ああ。いい知らせを待ってる。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7604402,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["7012"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1204,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7604401,7604402,7604403],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"ヤフォダ","count":24},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"レゼック","count":11},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"ネフェル","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[176044],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2177681598,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"7012":[1230]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NON